cff-version: 1.2.0
title: IMP Message Protocol
message: "If you use or implement this specification, please cite it as below."
type: standard
authors:
  - name: despulii
    email: despulii@gmail.com
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-18
abstract: >-
  A self-hosted-first messaging protocol in which a sender's identity is a
  cryptographically verifiable property of the sender's own domain: keys are
  published in DNS, every message is signed, and delivery is an HTTPS POST to
  a discovered endpoint. Authentication is a check rather than a reputation
  built over time.
license: CC0-1.0
repository-code: https://github.com/despulii-bit/imp
keywords:
  - messaging
  - protocol
  - self-hosted
  - ed25519
  - dns
